get="_blank">https://maskin.io/invoices/in_abc123</a></p><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#374151;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Need a change to your plan or billing details? Reply to this email and we&#x27;ll sort it out.</p><hr style="width:100%;border:none;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;border-color:#e5e7eb;margin-top:32px"/><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#6b7280;margin-top:16px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px">Sent by Maskin — the shop where AI does the work and humans set direction.</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#6b7280;margin-top:16px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px">You&#x27;re getting this because you have a Maskin account.<!-- --> <a href="https://maskin.io/settings/notifications" style="color:#6b7280;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Manage email preferences</a>.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"`;

exports[`renderTemplate > billing-receipt > matches the text snapshot 1`] = `
"PAYMENT RECEIVED

Thanks for using Maskin. Here's a receipt for your last billing cycle.

$49.00

Billing period: Jul 1, 2026 — Jul 31, 2026

View invoice https://maskin.io/invoices/in_abc123

Or paste this link into your browser: https://maskin.io/invoices/in_abc123

Need a change to your plan or billing details? Reply to this email and we'll sort it out.

----------------------------------------

Sent by Maskin — the shop where AI does the work and humans set direction.

You're getting this because you have a Maskin account. Manage email preferences https://maskin.io/settings/notifications."
`;

