exports[`renderTemplate > out-of-credits-alert > matches the text snapshot 1`] = `
"YOUR AGENTS HAVE PAUSED

Acme Widgets is out of credits, so every agent in the workspace has stopped mid-run.

Bets in flight won't move forward until credits are back. Anything that was queued is waiting; anything scheduled will miss its run.

Used 10,000 of 10,000 credits this cycle.

Upgrade plan https://maskin.io/billing/upgrade

Or paste this link into your browser: https://maskin.io/billing/upgrade

Agents resume automatically the moment credits are available again.

----------------------------------------

Sent by Maskin — the shop where AI does the work and humans set direction.

