om:16px;margin-left:0">This link expires in 30 minutes. If you didn&#x27;t ask to reset your password, you can safely ignore this email — your current password will keep working.</p><hr style="width:100%;border:none;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;border-color:#e5e7eb;margin-top:32px"/><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#6b7280;margin-top:16px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px">Sent by Maskin — the shop where AI does the work and humans set direction.</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#6b7280;margin-top:16px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px">You&#x27;re getting this because you have a Maskin account.<!-- --> <a href="https://maskin.io/settings/notifications" style="color:#6b7280;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline" target="_blank">Manage email preferences</a>.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"`;

exports[`renderTemplate > password-reset > matches the text snapshot 1`] = `
"RESET YOUR PASSWORD, SINDRE

We got a request to reset the password on your Maskin account. Set a new one so you can get back to running the shop.

Reset password https://maskin.io/reset?token=abc123

Or paste this link into your browser: https://maskin.io/reset?token=abc123

This link expires in 30 minutes. If you didn't ask to reset your password, you can safely ignore this email — your current password will keep working.

----------------------------------------

Sent by Maskin — the shop where AI does the work and humans set direction.

You're getting this because you have a Maskin account. Manage email preferences https://maskin.io/settings/notifications."
`;

